# Rebound's cast is optional, and the chance comes once (CR 702.88a): "you may cast this card from exile". Bot1 casts
# Ephemerate on turn 3, declines to cast it again at the turn 5 upkeep, and it stays in exile - it is not offered on a
# later upkeep, and it does not go to the graveyard. (The positive control is
# ephemerate-blinks-the-creature-and-rebounds-at-the-next-upkeep, where the same card is offered at the same moment.)

